# Global | opencitations | Open DOI citations
# GET | REST | CC0 citation data; API documentation CC BY 4.0 and RAMOSE code ISC are separate. Optional token encouraged, not required.
# Observed 200 | JSON | Official 180 requests/minute/IP; local cap 1 request/s.
